---
import '../styles/everyday.css';
const repo='https://github.com/NapNeko/NapCatQQ-Desktop';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<section class="section everyday-section" aria-labelledby="everyday-title"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div class="section-index">每天用起来，也顺手</div><h2 id="everyday-title">按自己的习惯，<br />把工作台摆好。</h2><p>需要的功能留下，常用的操作放近一点。</p></div>
  <div class="everyday-layout"><div class="appearance-demo"><div class="appearance-copy"><h3>选个喜欢的样子。</h3><p>明暗主题、侧栏样式，<br />还有可以按需开关的功能。</p></div><div class="appearance-preview" data-appearance="light" aria-label="主题外观示意"><aside><img src={`${base}media/logo.png`} width="27" height="27" alt="" /><span class="mini-item">概览</span><span class="mini-item active">机器人</span><span class="mini-item">聊天</span><span class="mini-item">应用端</span><span class="mini-item">设置</span></aside><div class="appearance-preview-main"><span class="preview-title">我的工作台</span><div class="preview-bot"><span class="preview-bot-icon">N</span><div><strong>NapCat</strong><span>本机 Windows</span></div><span class="preview-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><div class="preview-bot"><span class="preview-bot-icon sl">S</span><div><strong>SnowLuma</strong><span>远端 Linux</span></div><span class="preview-mark" aria-hidden="true"></span></div><p>主题示意</p></div></div><div class="appearance-controls" role="group" aria-label="查看主题示意"><button type="button" data-appearance-choice="light" aria-pressed="true">浅色</button><button type="button" data-appearance-choice="dark" aria-pressed="false">深色</button></div></div>
  <div class="everyday-details"><article><svg width="27" height="27" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="13" rx="2" /><path d="M3 13h18M8 21h8m-4-4v4" /></svg><h3>放进托盘，继续接收。</h3><p>按账号开启后台接收、头像托盘与消息提醒。关窗后，可按设置释放界面内存。</p></article><article><svg width="27" height="27" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h12l4 4v11H4V5Z" /><path d="M8 5v6h8V5M8 20v-6h8v6" /></svg><h3>配置留好，下次接着用。</h3><p>导出配置备份，覆盖升级，也可以把数据目录迁到另一块磁盘。</p><a class="text-link" href={`${repo}/blob/main/docs/user/README.md#备份与恢复配置`}>了解备份范围 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article><article class="shortcut-detail"><span class="shortcut-keys"><kbd>Ctrl</kbd><span>＋</span><kbd>Alt</kbd><span>＋</span><kbd>S</kbd></span><div><h3>截图，随手就来。</h3><p>可在截图按钮旁修改快捷键。</p></div></article></div></div>
</div></section>
<section class="get-started-section" aria-labelledby="download-title"><div class="container"><div class="download-panel"><div><img src={`${base}media/logo.png`} width="64" height="64" alt="" /><h2 id="download-title">下一步，装到你的桌面。</h2><p>下载 Windows 安装包，然后开始第一个 Bot。</p><div class="download-actions"><a class="button" href={`${repo}/releases/latest`}>下载 NapCatQQ Desktop</a><a class="text-link" href={`${repo}/blob/main/docs/user/README.md`}>打开使用指南 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><a class="release-link" href={`${repo}/releases`}>查看最近更新</a></div><div class="quick-questions"><details><summary>Desktop 支持哪些系统？</summary><p>客户端面向 Windows x64，支持 Windows 10 / 11 及 Windows Server 2016+。需要 WebView2；内嵌终端对系统版本另有要求，详见安装指南。</p></details><details><summary>可以管理服务器上的 Bot 吗？</summary><p>可以通过 SSH 管理远端 Linux，支持原生运行与 Docker 部署。环境准备和登录步骤见远端指南。</p><a href={`${repo}/blob/main/docs/user/remote-linux.md`}>远端使用指南 ↗</a></details><details><summary>软件关闭后，远端会怎样？</summary><p>远端 Bot 可以继续运行。安装并配置 ncd-watch 后，远端主机可以在 Desktop 退出后继续监控与通知。</p></details><details><summary>遇到问题，从哪里找帮助？</summary><p>先查用户指南和对应 Bot 的日志，也可以附上版本、运行方式与复现步骤提交 Issue。</p><a href={`${repo}/issues`}>前往 GitHub Issues ↗</a></details></div></div></div></section>
<script>
  const preview=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.appearance-preview')!;
  const buttons=[...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-appearance-choice]')];
  buttons.forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{
    preview.dataset.appearance=button.dataset.appearanceChoice;
    buttons.forEach(item=>item.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(item===button)));
  }));
</script>
